  "local_changes": [
    "Prefer native instance vtable exports and skip named neighboring MetaClass tables",
    "Preserve existing native and sidecar symbols during inference",
    "Reject unequal virtual counts before positional mapping or method-name inference",
    "Report rejection names, reasons, addresses and counts; --native-only bypasses inference",
    "Include recovered instance sizes in --details",
    "Mandatory Python offline verification before atomic publication; fail closed if verifier unavailable",
    "Complete resource-only KPI header allocation and serialized header normalization",
    "Set outer prelink protections, canonical zerofill offsets and removed LINKEDIT payloads",
    "Expand plist dictionary/array and forward IDREFs; reject missing, duplicate or cyclic IDs",
    "Canonical kmod name/version from bundle metadata",
    "Preserve complete standard SHA256 tables as data; resolve backward ADRP control flow",
    "Independent section/symbol/relocation/dependency/GOT/stub/kmod checks, native-byte and source-constant preservation",
    "Static ARMv8 AOT Kext lowering with source-bound embedded helper records, mandatory ISA gate, and XNU KCGEN resource-header stride verification; see docs/sdm835/ios18/armv8-validation.json."
  ],
